WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
ICT Baden.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.950
Software development from Karlsruhe, Germany.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.950
We build custom software for our clients –

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.160
from the control system to the cloud.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.520
In C# and .NET, on Linux, Windows and embedded devices.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.680
Industry 4.0 and IoT, energy management,

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.400
telecommunications, hosting and databases –

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.710
we know how these systems work together.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.900
We are a compact team with experienced partners –

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.440
based in Karlsruhe-Durlach, active in the developer community,

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.920
and used to working remotely with large companies.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:37.600
Alongside client projects, we build our own software for industry, labs and IT:

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.950
Lupe, Vitrine, Zutritt and Riegel for Windows –

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.100
EnterpriseBrowser and Industrial Keyboard for rugged Android devices.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.980
All of them free, under the MIT licence.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.600
ICT Baden.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.400
Getting things done.
